#. ~ Description of "royal robe"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"An ornately decorated robe with an unfamiliar royal symbol on it.  The humanoid figure on the seal has two pairs of eyes.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""

