#. ~ Description of "ancient burial shroud"
#: data/json/artifact/artifact_item_types.json
msgid ""
"A cloak of thin, faded cloth.  The faint silhouette of a long-dead humanoid is barely visible on it.  It is the only one of its kind.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""

